The text tables in this folder and the Rust code in ../ are a port of dizione
(https://github.com/n4ze3m/dizione, Apache-2.0, see LICENSE-dizione), the
phonemizer of tiny-voca (https://github.com/n4ze3m/tiny-voca, Apache-2.0).
The pronunciation data it reads at run time (lexicon, alignment table,
homograph weights, unknown-word model) is downloaded from the tiny-voca model
repository and is derived from CMUdict and the Wikipedia Homograph Data (see
their license files there).
